</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00068/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一盘石磨，材质为石膏，上面雕刻有一个投币口和一句话“收件人：阴间礼部张书吏”，投进去一角钱，就会自动转三分钟。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██省石料厂<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-██的休息室中，允许员工投币自磨豆浆。投进去的硬币将作为捐赠款。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>“有钱能使鬼推磨。”这话一点也不假，哼，这玩意儿一定是鬼造的</em>——Dr.shadeoi<br />
<em>我们喝豆浆都喝吐了，所以我们不会再投币了，不会！</em>——特工EVIL</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00068" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00068" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00068-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6316800&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610028953" alt="Steven the shadow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6316800)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;">Steven the shadow</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587022723 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Apr 2020 07:38</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00222/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张10m的裹尸布。当项目与一处于醉酒状态的人类个体处在一个单独的空间内时，项目将会瞬移至对象的身边，并完全包裹住对象的身体。期间对象能够正常呼吸但报告称感受到持续的“窒息感”。在异常效应显现十分钟后对象将会直接死亡，经鉴定死亡原因为窒息而死。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>████/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>████<br />
<strong>目前状态：</strong>Site-CN-75的标准异常物品收容柜内。</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00222" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00222" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00222-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yoghurt-rescuer" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3167340); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3167340&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610028953" alt="Yoghurt-rescuer" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3167340)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yoghurt-rescuer" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3167340); return false;">Yoghurt-rescuer</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590679306 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 May 2020 15:21</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00269/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一面挂镜，当一名正常人类个体面对该镜子5秒以上时，此人在镜子中的映像突然消失<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site64的一间公共厕所中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>保存于Site64异常物品仓库<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><br />
“大晚上的路过镜子看不见人可真是恐怖”——初级研究员Ginger</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00269" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00269" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00269-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ginger249-jackie" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4136896); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4136896&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610028953" alt="Ginger249-Jackie" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4136896)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ginger249-jackie" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4136896); return false;">Ginger249-Jackie</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1592457134 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">18 Jun 2020 05:12</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00419/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong><span style="font-size:x-large;">项目描述</span>：</strong>一副由<span style="font-size:x-large;">████公司</span>生产的<span style="font-size:x-large;">███眼镜</span>，会使<span style="font-size:x-large;">佩戴者</span>认为其所看到的<span style="font-size:x-large;">文字</span>中的<span style="font-size:x-large;">名词部分</span>比<span style="font-size:x-large;">其他部分</span>要大一些。<br />
<strong>回收<span style="font-size:x-large;">日期</span>：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收<span style="font-size:x-large;">地点</span>：</strong><span style="font-size:x-large;">████公司专卖店</span>。<br />
<strong>当前<span style="font-size:x-large;">状态</span>：</strong>存放于Dr.K的<span style="font-size:x-large;">办公室</span>内。<br />
<strong><span style="font-size:x-large;">笔记</span>：</strong><em>确实是大<strong>亿</strong>些。&#8212;Dr.K</em></p>
